MackTuesday wrote:
>
> Apparently there is a connection between being confused and certain
> types of enchantment.  What is it?

Almost every type of scroll does something different
than usual if you're confused.  You end up mispronouncing
the magic words.  It's worth experimenting a bit with each
type once you have a spare.

> Is there a way to protect against polymorph traps that doesn't require
> a lucky find?  (Since yesterday I have discovered that among my rings I
> had polymorph control and searching.)

A few types of armor give complete immunity to some
types of trap and other specific types of problems.  As
opposed to other armor that gives statistical immunity
to a different set of problems.

> If my stash becomes engulfed, will whacking the engulfer damage my
> stuff?

No.  Slash away.

